sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuário (sk)
  participant API as API (ipm-group-api)
  participant DB as SSOT (banco ssot)
  participant P as Publisher (ipm-group-publisher)
  participant NATS as NATS (Stream DESIRED)
  participant CONS as Consumidor (ipm.user Controller)

  U->>API: POST /v1/ipm/groups {organizationId, name, description, roles, deletionProtection}
  API->>API: valida token JWT, e-mail verificado e escopo da Organization
  API->>API: valida roles contra catálogo (CatalogConsumer de ipm.role)
  API->>API: exige ipm.group.bind para membros que atribuem roles
  API->>API: valida cota de grupos por organização (máx 50)
  API->>DB: Transação SQL atômica: INSERT ipm.group (Ready), INSERT outbox, INSERT idempotency
  API-->>U: 201 Created (Resource completo: phase Ready, observedGeneration 1)
  P->>DB: lê outbox pendente por ordem de sequence
  P->>NATS: publica desired.ipm.group.<resourceId>
  P->>DB: UPDATE outbox SET published_at = now()
  NATS->>CONS: entrega desired.changed para caches e expansão de roles em usuários
